  "abstract": "Reach and publish self-hosted LLM endpoints with Tailscale. Covers installation and auth keys, MagicDNS and HTTPS certificates, tailscale serve to a loopback gateway, Funnel and its limits, tags, grants and policy tests, key expiry for servers, updating, troubleshooting, an exposure-audit script, and combos for Ollama and for a Caddy catalog front with LiteLLM.",
